│                    MULTI-LANGUAGE VIBE CODE FLOW                            │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                                             │
│  1. REQUEST RECEIVED (Any Language)                                        │
│     ├── Detect source language                                             │
│     ├── Extract raw request text                                           │
│     └── Identify language signals (Vietnamese, Chinese, Japanese, etc.)     │
